* Helper module for syscall-flink-ffork-fwait.a -- not a test on its own.
* Exits immediately with a distinctive status (77) so a parent process
* forking/waiting on it can confirm F$Wait returns the real exit code.

 nam ChildPrg
 mod eom,nm,$11,$81,start,$0100
nm fcs /ChildPrg/
start equ *
 ldb #77
 swi2
 fcb $06
 emod
eom equ *
